      "value": "I guess here a few pictures for the whole thing:\n1. Idle Pose\n2. Auto converted dynamic bones (two on each ear root)\n3. Using only one PhysBone, on the hair root, the root bone is not animated\n4. Original DynamicBone behaviour with auto conversion turned off. One DynamicBone component per ear.\n5. Same as 2, but on newest build, 1203\n6. New upload with PhysBone working correctly on 1203 with two bones and their roots animated. Uploaded using SDK package 3.0.6\n1 through 4 are pictures from the previous post, from build 1991, that still apply and behave similarly on the current build\n3, 4 and 6 are showing the expected result of the animation. 2 and 5 are broken.\nOn other peoples avatars the results seem to vary, one of my friends has their ears on a auto converted avatar move in a way, that they disappear entirely (7 PB & 8 DB)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
