  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "this: https://vrchat.canny.io/avatar-dynamics-reports-and-feedback/p/1201-physbones-resist-animations-even-with-isanimated-checked\ndid fix the issue for newly uploaded avatars, but existing, auto converted avatars which have a root bone animation still don't behave correctly\nScreenshot taken on build 1203 with a auto converted avatar.\nThe same setup on a newly uploaded, in editor converted avatar (on SDK 3.0.6) works flawlessly\n\nAt this time the original post is still marked as in progress, so it might get fixed in the next client update and there are more pressing issues (jitter, as outlined here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/physbones-suddenly-flickering-after-new-update), but this issue should be brought up and addressed non the less",
